{"id":"d2f1dbaa18904ef6","group":"58","path":"58/batch16/58-df-zfc-recursion2-high-set.md","title":"ZFC Recursion2 High Set","display":"df-zfc-recursion2-high-set — ZFC Recursion2 High Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-recursion2-high-set","aliases":["58-df-zfc-recursion2-high-set","58-df-zfc-recursion3-high-set"],"display":"df-zfc-recursion2-high-set — ZFC Recursion2 High Set","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-turing-reducible]]","[[58-df-zfc-recursion2-jump-operator]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-recursion2-high-set"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-recursion2-high-set</span><span>58-df-zfc-recursion3-high-set</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-recursion2-high-set — ZFC Recursion2 High Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"7f65c348d236e554\" href=\"?note=7f65c348d236e554\" title=\"58-df-turing-reducible\">58-df-turing-reducible</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9aa91af779dadb4b\" href=\"?note=9aa91af779dadb4b\" title=\"58-df-zfc-recursion2-jump-operator\">58-df-zfc-recursion2-jump-operator</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(A\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2JumpOperator}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2JumpOperator}_S\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"9aa91af779dadb4b\" href=\"?note=9aa91af779dadb4b\" title=\"58-df-zfc-recursion2-jump-operator\">58-df-zfc-recursion2-jump-operator</a>) and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq_T\">\\(\\leq_T\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"7f65c348d236e554\" href=\"?note=7f65c348d236e554\" title=\"58-df-turing-reducible\">58-df-turing-reducible</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2HighSet}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion3HighSet}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2HighSet}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion3HighSet}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursion2\\text{-}high\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2HighSet}_S(A)\\leftrightarrow A\\subseteq\\omega\\land\\exists J_A,J_0,J_1\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2JumpOperator}_S(J_A,A)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2JumpOperator}_S(J_0,\\varnothing)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2JumpOperator}_S(J_1,J_0)\\land J_1\\leq_TJ_A\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursion2\\text{-}high\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2HighSet}_S(A)\\leftrightarrow A\\subseteq\\omega\\land\\exists J_A,J_0,J_1\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2JumpOperator}_S(J_A,A)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2JumpOperator}_S(J_0,\\varnothing)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2JumpOperator}_S(J_1,J_0)\\land J_1\\leq_TJ_A\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursion3\\text{-}high\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcRecursion3HighSet}_S(A)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2HighSet}_S(A)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursion3\\text{-}high\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcRecursion3HighSet}_S(A)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2HighSet}_S(A)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary ZFC definition.</li>\n<li>Merges the recursion3 high-set variant, which is the same Turing-jump condition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-turing-reducible","status":"resolved","id":"7f65c348d236e554","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-turing-reducible]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-recursion2-jump-operator","status":"resolved","id":"9aa91af779dadb4b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-recursion2-jump-operator]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-recursion2-jump-operator","status":"resolved","id":"9aa91af779dadb4b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2JumpOperator}_S$ (see [[58-df-zfc-recursion2-jump-operator]]) and $\\leq_T$ (see [[58-df-turing-reducible]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-turing-reducible","status":"resolved","id":"7f65c348d236e554","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2JumpOperator}_S$ (see [[58-df-zfc-recursion2-jump-operator]]) and $\\leq_T$ (see [[58-df-turing-reducible]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2JumpOperator}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\leq_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2HighSet}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion3HighSet}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":fals